From 3488b988a1aae214a638f6dea22954af02b43f59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lotus Developer <dev@lotus.org>
Date: Thu, 16 Apr 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v2: add v7 transaction schema, 3-branch outputs, and signing
 machinery

Add Lotus V2 v7 transaction framing, 3-branch output codecs (Pay, Stake,
Vault/Contract + AssetId), field size checks, and Ed25519 / BIP340 Schnorr /
MuSig2 signing primitives with unit tests.
